flowchart LR
    A[K+N System] --> B[SOAP Endpoint]
    B --> C{Authenticate Request}
    C -- Success --> D[Dispatch Operation]
    C -- Fault --> J[Return SOAP Response]
    D --> E{Is Write Operation?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Idempotency Check]
    F -- New Request --> G[Translate Codes]
    F -- Replay Cached --> J
    F -- Processing --> J
    E -- No --> G
    G --> H[Lookup Policy]
    H --> I[Execute Operation]
    I --> J